        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIrpDxsml_RHY3aQ2TNHHHYyOZAhVRkwBGrPSxXz-gJH-dGsg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The best daycare in the West Island. Dedicated staff beautifully decorated and clean. The food is amazing. You will love it.",
        "time": 1707851397,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Allison Murphy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117326406369825722707/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIB-aKmMPgdClMWx_-uMVh18YTJowMMQOuWenW1SaOpMEHfMw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "My son began attending this daycare in September 2020 during the COVID pandemic. Despite the immense stress that the employees were under, they are always welcoming and enthusiastic when my son arrives. As a parent placing my child in daycare for the first time, it is such a huge relief to know that my son is in safe and caring hands.The food served to the children is of the highest quality and my usually picky eater has been exposed to a variety of healthy and delicious foods. I myself have ordered food through their twice weekly catering service and I can confirm that the food is delicious!The educators are attentive and caring despite the heavy workload and now having to work all day wearing masks. Questions posed to administration are answered quickly and concisely.  I am very happy with L'Univers en Moi and I am very happy with the nurturing and stimulating environment that they provide my son. The work of daycare educators is greatly underappreciated and we as parents are fortunate to find caring and lovely people to watch over our children.",
        "time": 1611244061,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "maha sale",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105710908992759658978/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIk108x-RtoxOfHBtmSPfuD-NaaEAoEFcAXFIx5mipQaAHqkw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Unprofessional staff, once I went to pick up my 18 months son, and the educators were not able to find him, after close to 10 minutes they found him in one of the bathrooms with the door closed.",
        "time": 1683067423,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lilia Ouguergouz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109562187297168816295/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXVVUQopTkS23hDly9Z4nVD6jOlZWxvkg4QFA80xPZLLxXFowGh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The worst daycare I've ever placed my daughter in. After just two weeks of settling-in, they told me they had no solution for her, and I even found her in the high chair outside with the caregiver, crying and without any comfort. Avoid this place at all costs! Leaving a child crying for hours without any assistance is truly incompetent.\nMy daughter started having nightmares every night because of them!",
